<title>NEW ZEALAND: Nuplex lifts half yr profit to NZ$4.63mln.</title>
<headline>Nuplex lifts half yr profit to NZ$4.63mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to Dec 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  4.63 vs 4.26</p>
<p>Dividend carries 2.7 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date March 21</p>
<p>Reg date March 7</p>
<p>    Ex div   March 10</p>
<p>Note - Nuplex Industries Ltd manufactures resins, distributes building products and recycles waste.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
